      "checked_at": "2026-10-15",
      "fact": "Read 15 October 2026 (page last updated 9 February 2026). Behaviours that attract ATO attention include not declaring all income and over-claiming expenses, not lodging and paying in full and on time, paying employees in cash, using business funds for private lifestyle and poor record keeping.",
